WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit tall with soles together.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Support the knees with blankets.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Hold the feet and sit tall, or fold slightly.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe slowly.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Draw knees together to exit.
